{"id":23037,"name":"向着不可追问处","rarity":5,"path":"Mage","desc":"智识命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「博识学会的信件处理完毕。」</i>\\n<i>「模拟宇宙正常运行中……」</i>\\n<i>「著作合集已再版。」</i>\\n<i>「嘘，小点声，别吵到了黑塔女士……」</i>\\n\\n……银河边境的高塔内，人偶们有条不紊地处理着各项杂事，等待着她的出现。\\n时光倏忽而过，数不尽的人物如流星般划过历史的夜空，闪耀一时，终归沉寂。\\n<i>「黑塔女士已经很久没露面了……」</i>\\n<i>「她还在思考么……」</i>\\n\\n<i>「哼，以为得出几个公理就结束了？」</i>\\n她伸个懒腰，从演算中抬起头，似乎又有想法浮现——\\n<i>「没有什么是不可置疑的，我偏要追问到底！」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23037,"name":"思维游戏","desc":"使装备者的暴击率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放终结技时，使装备者造成的战技和终结技伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#5[i]</unbreak>回合。装备者施放终结技后，若本次终结技消耗的能量大于等于<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>点，恢复1个战技点。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,2,140,0.6,3]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.14,2,140,0.7,3]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.16,2,140,0.8,3]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.18,2,140,0.9,3]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.2,2,140,1,3]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110201,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110202,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110202,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":201.6,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000}